1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,425
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:04,375 --> 00:00:07,327
This is Episode 35.

3
00:00:07,327 --> 00:00:11,289
A big pile of parcels lands in the street.

4
00:00:11,289 --> 00:00:13,271
Round ones.

5
00:00:13,271 --> 00:00:15,305
Square ones.

6
00:00:15,305 --> 00:00:17,526
Triangle ones.

7
00:00:17,526 --> 00:00:19,494
All mixed up.

8
00:00:19,494 --> 00:00:22,632
Maya carries them one at a time.

9
00:00:22,632 --> 00:00:24,228
Oh no!

10
00:00:24,228 --> 00:00:27,127
She gives a square to Sammy.

11
00:00:27,127 --> 00:00:29,042
Wrong friend.

12
00:00:29,042 --> 00:00:31,821
Here comes the sorting table.

13
00:00:31,821 --> 00:00:35,186
Maya dumps the whole pile on top.

14
00:00:35,186 --> 00:00:37,433
The lever flips.

15
00:00:37,433 --> 00:00:41,077
Round goes down the round chute to Sammy.

16
00:00:41,077 --> 00:00:44,734
Square goes down the square chute to Eddie.

17
00:00:44,734 --> 00:00:48,909
Triangle goes down the triangle chute to Lulu.

18
00:00:48,909 --> 00:00:51,781
Right thing, right friend.

19
00:00:51,781 --> 00:00:54,587
Now you know EventBridge!

20
00:00:54,587 --> 00:00:59,281
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

